<title>SWEDEN: Skandia Q1 operating profit up 61 pct.</title>
<headline>Skandia Q1 operating profit up 61 pct.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish insurer Skandia on Tuesday reported these earnings for the first three months of the year, ending on March 31.</p>
<p>			     (million crowns unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit			 1,481  vs  921</p>
<p>Operating profit for non-life</p>
<p>  and reinsurance			 1,134  vs  794</p>
<p> Operating profit for life, funds     518  vs  318</p>
<p> Shr (crowns, rolling 12 months)	 14  vs   11</p>
<p>Net assets/shr (crowns,</p>
<p>  rolling 12 months)			181  vs  174</p>
<p> Total premium income		  18,585  vs 14,653</p>
<p>Premium income, non-life</p>
<p>  and reinsurance			 6,968  vs  6,985</p>
<p> Premium income, life, funds	 11,619  vs  7,687</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-7001017</p>
</text>
